<title>USA: TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tennessee 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$825,000 St Jude men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denote seeding)</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 15-Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>3-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 7-6 (7-0)</p>
<p>5-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat 12-Chris Woodruff (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>7-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-2</p>
<p>2-6 6-3</p>
<p>8-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 7-5</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>13-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Javier Frana (Argentina) 6-0</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
